   "text": "How b31_prep_ai's s04 (Nes Mathioudakis's SHIFT Task 3.1 file) is drawn, step by step, in sentence mode: the updated text comes from a haipipe-draft draft and the Word file is built last. The seconds are one rebuild on JL's\nMac (2026-10-11); red marks what costs most or is still open.",
